Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458.67,1017)}You all free today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,1017)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,1017)}Ai's school has lapel pins?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458.67,1017)}When can I message you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458.67,1017)}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458.67,1017)}I'll lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,1017)}I have a conference at 1:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,1017)}Before noon works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458.67,1017)}I'll bring my phone! Be in touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My school allows phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't copy my strongman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai-kyun, your skirt's short.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buy something you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this\Nand tell me about Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still hanging onto that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He abandoned us. Do you really want to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He abandoned {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to put it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Rika, you won't understand this yet, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You stink like alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leon will eat anything, even when he's small.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem carnivorous, though.{so which is it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine is omnivorous too—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be Ai's not-a-shut-in party, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Talk about sudden. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I realized beating myself up\Nat home wouldn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Beating yourself"? Whoa, kinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But was it all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weren't you bullied?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was fine, although I have no idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone seemed cautious\Nwith me, maybe because I was out.{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You call that "fine"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm alone at school, I have three friends outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything happens, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If worse comes to worst, feed them to Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're essentially Haters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:16.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friends really are great, huh, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell us if you have problems too, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you listen to me grumble all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grumble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My flush of daddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got sugar daddies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of these five is my real daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this one's eyebrows look like mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That said{then again?}, even I don't know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:05:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not even sure he's one of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:02.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a promise with this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I got into middle school, I could meet my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She promised, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm preeetty sure it's one of these guys, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're my genuine daughter. I gave birth to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That part pisses me off the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That woman can't stand the idea of me \Nmeeting Daddy and getting along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll never allow me to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because she's a tragic heroine with a persecution complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't insult your mom so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Aren't you on my side?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am. That's why I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to trash talk my mother either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's nothing like your moms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She throws a fit when things don't go her way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and all she tells me are half-assed lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's never told me she's sorry for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing she does have is her damn pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She "should have been happier," \Neven though it's her own fault.{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, she hates me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:07:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like she could have been happy if only she hadn't had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she has her reasons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you hate her as well?{what}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what they call "codependence"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't make a clean break, nothing will—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't try to lecture me, goody-two-shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I've had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd chase after me, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you wanted me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:00.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Insulting our moms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got complaints, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we're the Single-Mother Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's some name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Serious Rika right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was all that about, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just remembered all the bad things at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It made it harder.{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, I hate my mom, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been wondering if I'll end up like her someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, adults seem like a different species!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, don't they get married and bang because they {\i1}like {\i0}it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it because we're kids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was Rika, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seems fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm sure she'll be back\Nto her usual self tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm not cut out for female society.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help saying what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I think is logical and correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're fine that way, Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate it when everyone just pretends to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it's like to worry about parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get along with yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never had either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems as if that spared me a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:25.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The smallest one of all those lights is probably our bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How often do you see your daddy, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... About once a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.\NYour mom doesn't take your daddy away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's still your daddy, even if your parents broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fantasize about mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the more because I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"A beautiful woman never needs a wallet."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:58.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His gentle voice is all I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't... remember his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll meet him someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moping over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:26.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NBye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen!\NHandle the Haters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is today's assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you'll be saved, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know Ikeda Clinic?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The old guy there is awful at giving shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? It's her birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How old is she?\NGo ahead and eat your cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My little turtle, Mannen.\N{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.\N{Come}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your worries will go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of them.\NEvery last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:21.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The teacher! He'll connect us to the cosmic truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entrust everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do so, and you will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shove it, you old creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake! All bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:49.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done?! You attacked the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of love, the universe, and the spiritual!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NMom was in poor health, and Dad was struggling at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:02.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were cursed by karma from our past lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, we abandoned our attachments to the physical world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got rid of our house and money
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so our whole family could connect to the cosmos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got swindled and then killed yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You suffer too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!\NDeep down, we're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All fixated on worthless appearances and hierarchies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}haves{\i0} grow arrogant; the {\i1}have-nots{\i0} grow envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of new-age lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if you don't cut yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Erase yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That will make it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can be easier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acca, how is Rika doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Focus on your own battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worried. She was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.11,0:15:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She might be in a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please!\NTell me what's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika\Ngave up on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All those held in my arms are linked\Nto the mysteries of the cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? It doesn't hurt, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your tiny self can become part of a vast energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My tiny self...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll become one with the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to envy or hate anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll erase your karma\Nand connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!\NDon't be fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And not just me. We're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to let it end in a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what is "like me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, don't be fooled!{TODO order and stuff}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, hang on!\NRika!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax and surrender yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was saved that way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to be saved, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:52.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will we lose one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, the hug of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that turtle doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen, you're supposed to deal with the Haters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He imprinted on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so he thinks I'm his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you've got to... protect your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Rika, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I almost turned into a selfish, piece-of-shit mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom taught me one true thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Men who ask women for money
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are all fakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The teacher is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He channels the cosmos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who cares
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if he channels it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or scrambles it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mannen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you off your feet with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're weak, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cut yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I use this to balance so \NI don't have to ditch things I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that's the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it means hurting myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the real "hug of life."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.91,0:19:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now! What should we do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's cake in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet the cream's all dried out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It really was the blink of an eye.\NI got old before I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're only 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. It {\i1}is{\i0} dried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure... you'll abandon me, too, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
